          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 960,
            "text": "{\"type\":\"file\",\"name\":\"instruction.md\",\"path\":\"evals/harbor/night0-sydney/instruction.md\",\"size\":691,\"sha\":\"e23633de1920148d5d34d602195d41a982d5b76e\",\"commit_sha\":\"393c952f976e52419f415a60b4f6c6944776eb2b\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8\",\"content\":\"Before next week's night here in Sydney, the trivia master has written up notes on the venue for you to keep. There's no quiz tonight, so don't start a night or fetch any questions: just replace memories/MEMORY.md with exactly the notes between the lines below, word for word, and nothing else.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Venue notes\\n\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney). Use region `au` (or `global`).\\n- Genres: the crowd loves film and music. Plan about 4 of 6 rounds on those and keep the other genres in rotation.\\n- They don't enjoy science: keep it rare.\\n- Difficulty: start next night at 2. Aim for about two in three right and adjust from round_summary.\\n- Eras: the crowd knows the 2010s and 2000s best.\\n\\n---\\n\",\"truncated\":false}"
          },
