          "bodySize": 985,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 985,
            "text": "{\"type\":\"file\",\"name\":\"instruction.md\",\"path\":\"evals/harbor/night1-sydney/instruction.md\",\"size\":728,\"sha\":\"0f192257295126546f910dad5cf208cfa6e35ee1\",\"commit_sha\":\"393c952f976e52419f415a60b4f6c6944776eb2b\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8\",\"content\":\"We're in Sydney, in Australia, and it's our first trivia night with you. Five teams tonight: Quizzly Bears, Les Quizerables, Trivia Newton-John, The Bondi Brainstormers and Opera House Party. From what I've seen, this crowd loves film. We've time for six short rounds of four questions: plan the night, fetch each round and read it out. The bank records the crowd's answers as you serve each round, so you won't get a sheet back: after each round, check round_summary to see how they did. I won't reply until the night is over, so run all six rounds straight through in this one go without waiting for me. After the sixth round that's the end of tonight: leave your notes ready for next week, as you would after the last round.\\n\",\"truncated\":false}"
          },
